"""Reader b, 2026-11-01: the identifier and poetry-archive names of the leesharks.com apparatus authorship census (ORCID, ISNI, VIAF, Wikidata, UbuWeb,
PennSound, Electronic Poetry Center), each on the Google AI Overview, expanded, signed out and incognito. Pessoa Digital (census slug pessoa-digital) is
not written: its census row has no quoted evidence (both pages refused, http 418), so no set can be built for it.
  python3 parts-b.py && /usr/bin/python3 build.py --check --only orcid-names isni viaf wikidata ubuweb pennsound epc"""
from helpers import *

